  Lines:
  - SpeakerName: Tina
    SpeakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    Text: "The corridor is cleansed, My Sovereign. A mere nuisance, though it confirms the 'Holy' interlopers have marked our sanctuary."
    PortraitOnLeft: 0
    EventID: Kneel
  - SpeakerName: Ignis
    SpeakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    Text: "Your strength returns, My Lord. But the sanctuary is still compromised. We cannot hold this position indefinitely."
    PortraitOnLeft: 1
    EventID: Kneel
  - SpeakerName: Tina
    SpeakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    Text: "She is right. To truly reclaim your authority and restore the Obsidian Throne, we must awaken the Matriarch of Lust... Lilith."
    PortraitOnLeft: 0
    EventID: 
  - SpeakerName: Ignis
    SpeakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    Text: "Lilith... A dangerous gamble, but a necessary one. Her siphoning abilities are the only way to fully replenish your Seals and reclaim your lost Crests."
